# Keep these Unity project files tracked:
# - Assets/** including .meta files, scenes, prefabs, ScriptableObjects, sprites,
#   audio, models, fonts, plugins, Resources, StreamingAssets, and TextMesh Pro.
# - Packages/manifest.json and Packages/packages-lock.json.
# - ProjectSettings/** including ProjectVersion.txt and project .asset settings.

